      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili nawa cheŋi kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, kwadiŋi ambanda ayedi, mama yawu wumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elili wuvumbi muEjipitu. Kwenoku elili wuvumbi hawusanda wawu, ayikwatakwatili hamayeli awu, ayichikitili hantulu jawu jawujiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majinawu, iwu Ohola yowu mukulumpi, iwu mwanyikindi Oholiba. Hiyakwikala amami, hiyakuvwala anyana amayala nawambanda. Majinawu, Samariya diyi Ohola, Yerusalema diyi Oholiba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohola hakudinata muwuvumbi, iku wuchidi wamami. Hakusweja kukeŋa nankashi atujila twindi, wowu aAshuri adihata nindi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "avwala mahina awuzeeli, anguvulu nawanyuli, wejima wawu anyikwenzi akwila kuyitala wutiya nikumuchima to, akwatuwalu, endelaŋa hatuwalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakukoŋakoŋa nawu wuvumbi, wejima wawu hiyamayala amuAshuri akutonda chakutonda hohu; onsu aswejeli kukeŋayi hakuditamisha nawakishi awu akutuŋa ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha kuEjipitu halekaŋa mawuvumbi induku; hadiŋiyi nsanda akaminaŋa nindi, amuchikitilaŋa hantulu yindi yawujiki, amwichililaŋa wuvumbi wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chinamuheni kudi atujila twindi, wowu aAshuri akeŋeliyi nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa amwekesheli iheŋu dindi. Anyanindi amayala nawambanda ayikwatili, yomwenindi amujahili nampoku yakabali. Hakushiya niijina dampuhu yatama hakachi kawambanda, muloŋa amusompesheli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanyikindi Oholiba wachimweni, osweja nikuditokesha chakubadika yaya yindi, hakubadika kukeŋa nankashi amayala; mawuvumbi indi abadika niayaya yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakusweja kukeŋa nankashi aAshuri, anguvulu nawanyuli, adihatiliyi nawu, avwalilaŋa wuvwalu wasweja lubanji nankashi, akwatuwalu adi nakwendela hatuwalu, wejima wawu anyikwenzi akwila kuyitala wutiya nikumuchima to. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namweni nami anamutamishi, mwayedi wawu aya dehi njila yoyimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuswejesha nankashi nimawuvumbi indi. Muloŋa yena wamweni amayala asonekawu hambaŋu, yoyifwikija yawaKaladeya yakusoneka nawulombu wuchinana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "avwala nyiya mumbunda jawu, kunyitu yawu ajiŋajiŋaku mahina akuloomba, kuyitala wejima wawu hiyandumi hawu, afwana neyi antu akuBabiloni ekala muKaladeya, ituŋa dasemukililuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanayimoniyi namesu indi, hakuyikeŋa nankashi, hakuyitemeshela antemesha muKaladeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akuBabiloni hiyakwinza kudi yena mukadidi kakukeŋa, hiyakumutamisha nawuvumbi wawu, hakudijilola nawu, ayifumisha nikumuchima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimu mwamwekesheleliyi mawuvumbi indi, mwamwekesheleliyi niiheŋu dindi; nimufumisha nikumuchima wami neyi chinafumishili yaya yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, chavulishayi mawuvumbi indi ho-o, hakwanakana mafuku awusanda windi, helilaŋayi wuvumbi mwituŋa daEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakusweja nikukeŋa nankashi atujila twindi, akweti mbiji yidi neyi mbiji yayimbulu, akweti nilusemu ludi neyi lwawatuwalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiwukwanakana chiwabajaminaŋa hawusanda weyi, chakuchikitilaŋawu hantulu kudi aEjipitu, chakukwatilaŋawu hamayeli ahawusanda weyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi eyi Oholiba, Mwanta Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiya, nakakusa ŋumwina atujila tweyi iwafumisna dehi kumuchima, nakakuzemwinawu zemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wowu aBabiloni nawaKaladeya, nawaPekodi naShowa naKowa, hamu nawaAshuri ejima; anyikwenzi akwila kuyitala wutiya nikumuchima tó, wejima wawu anguvulu nawanyuli ho-o, atulamba nawantu atúumbakana, wejima wawu adi nakwendela hatuwalu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakuzemukila nayitwa, namakálu, namatemba, nachipompelu chanyuza yawantu; akakutandamina nankebu janyanya nŋamaneni, nimateŋa ayikuŋu kwi-ndo; nakayinka mudimu wakukusompesha, akakusompesha mwaya kusompesha kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakuzuwila namukawu, akakukoŋa chakukulendumukila; akakuketula nimazulu nimatu; antu eyi akashalaku akadimbuka nampoku yakabali. Anyaneyi amayala nawambanda akayikwata; antu eyi akashalaku akayilasha nakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakuvúula mahineyi, akakufumisha yuma yeyi yayiwahi yiwadileŋaleŋaŋa nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimu munakakuketwishila kubajama kweyi, niwuvumbi weyi wafumishili kuEjipitu; kulonda wakabuli kuyifumbwila cheŋi mesu eyi, wakabuli kwanuka nawa cheŋi Ejipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Mwanta Yehova nindi, Nukukuhana kudi antu wekala nawu nankunyi, wowu antu iwafumisha dehi kumuchima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akakukoŋa chankunyi hohu, akakufumisha yuma yejima wakabakeni, akakushiya nzekesi chakadi nikachuma kakuvwala, iheŋu damawuvumbi eyi dakamwekana, nikubajama kweyi nimawuvumbi eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakukoŋa yumiyi nanochu chiwunalondeli nyuza yikwawu nakwila nawu wuvumbi, nichiwunadijiloli nawakishi awu akutuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunayi dehi munjila yayaya yeyi, dichi nakakwinka luŋasa lwindi muchikasa cheyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Wakanwa muluŋasa lwayaya yeyi, luŋasolu lwakunama lweneni. Akakuseha, akakuyiŋila. Muluŋasolu mudi yayivulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenzala kusheta nayihuŋu, naluŋasa lwakuhayama, lwakushala wunka, lwoluŋasa lwayaya yeyi Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalunwa, wakalumanisha to, wakakeleketa niyizanda yalu, wakatabola nimayeli eyi; muloŋa ami nahoshumu dehi. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mwanta Yehova nahoshi nindi, China chiwunanvulameni, chiwunannatili kunyima, komana wakakoola kubajama kweyi nimawuvumbi eyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova waŋilili nawa nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, keŋa wusompeshi Ohola naOholiba, tahindi? Neyi chochu, yishimwini yishimashima yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wena aneli wuvumbi, mumakasawu mudi mashi, aneli wuvumbi nawakishi awu akutuŋa; anyanawu amayala anvweleleluwu ami, anayihanwishi mukesi, kulonda akayilashi nakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu nawa mwanankoŋuwu, ifuku dodimu anatamishi malalami, anajiloli sabata jami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena akwila iku anajahili dehi anyanawu kudi akishi awu akutuŋa, ifuku dodimu hiyakwinza mumalalami nakujilolamu. Tiyenu ntahi mwaneluwu mukachi ketala dami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chuma chikwawu nawa, munatambiki antu afuma kwakulehi; atemesheleluwu ntemesha, enza nikwinza. Hiwukuyiwelela, hiwukudikwitakwita wulombu kumesu, hiwukudileŋaleŋa nayuma yayiwahi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiwukushakama nihakadidi kawanta, iku kudi mesa yakwala dehi, washahu dehi niinsensi yami, nimanji ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikukutiyakana ipumba daluntu ludi nakuluŋa nayena, afumishili mwisaŋa asakusheta, hiyakuyileta hamu nawantu akadi kulema. Wena hiyakuyivwika mwayedi wawu yikomu kumakasawu, niyibaŋula yalubanji kunyitu yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumutena owu mumbanda wakulila dehi mumawuvumbi, nami, Ichi dinu wena akela nindi mawuvumbi, niyena nawa wakela nawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋilili mudi yena neyi cheŋilaŋawu mudi mumbanda wachivumbi. Dichi cheŋililuwu mudi Ohola naOholiba, ambanda abajama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu aloŋa diwu akayisompesha mwasompeshelaŋawu ayivumbi awambanda, nimwasompeshelaŋawu ambanda apwekeshaŋa mashi. Muloŋa wena hiyayivumbi awambanda, mumakasawu nawa mudi mashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Mwanta Yehova nindi, Nakayiletela chipompelu, nakayihana kulonda akayizukumoni nakuyibuwabuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chipompelu ochu chakayasa malola, chakayijahola nampoku jawu jatubali; akajaha anyanawu amayala nawambanda, akocha matalawu nakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimu nakaketwishila mwituŋa kubajama, kulonda ambanda ejima akadiziluku kubula kwimbujola kubajama kwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akayilubwili kubajama kwenu, nshidi jawakishi enu akutuŋa mwakajikoola. Mwakeluka nenu yami Mwanta Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
